'''Mighty Thermae D-Lux''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]] slightly increases attack power. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]] increases health, damage, freeze time and Omni-Strike reach, and grants [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] target and [[Immune to Toxic|Toxic Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]]. It was later added into [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

